    → Redis: player:player1 = {displayName: "xX_ProGamer_Xx", ...}

ScoreSubmitted(main, player1, 15000)
    → Redis: ZADD leaderboard:main 15000 player1
    → 🏆 NEW HIGH SCORE | Player: xX_ProGamer_Xx | Score: 15,000 | Rank: #42
